---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AuditExplorer from '../components/AuditExplorer.astro';
import Code from '../components/Code.astro';
import { plan, money } from '../data/business';
import { orderHref } from '../data/order';
import { organizationSchema } from '../data/schema';
const audit = plan('audit');
const foundation = plan('foundation');
const maintain = plan('maintain');
---
<Base title="Wardith — Be the business AI recommends" description="Understand and improve how your business appears in AI recommendations. An independent written audit for £250, with evidence and clear next steps.">
  <section class="signal-hero">
    <img class="hero-art" src="/signal-lens.webp" alt="" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="shell hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Independent AI visibility for UK businesses</p>
      <h1>Be the business<br /><span>AI recommends.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Your next customer might ask ChatGPT who to use. We find out whether you’re in the answer, and what could improve your chances.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-accent" href={orderHref}>Get your visibility audit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="hero-price">{money(audit.price)}<small>One-off. Yours to keep.</small></span></div>
      <a class="hero-secondary" href="#inside-the-audit">See what you get <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-caption" aria-hidden="true"><span>Less guesswork.</span><span>More clarity.</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="assistant-rail" aria-label="Assistants we examine"><div class="shell rail-inner"><p>An independent view<br />across the major assistants.</p><div class="assistant-names"><span>ChatGPT</span><span>Google</span><span>Copilot</span><span>Perplexity</span></div></div></section>

  <section class="section introduction"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / A different way to be found</p><h2>A strong business can still<br />be missing from the answer.</h2></div><div class="intro-bottom"><p>When someone asks an AI for a recommendation, they may get just a handful of names. Your website and the information around it help these systems understand whether you belong in that answer.</p><p>Wardith looks at what the assistants actually say, investigates the information they can find, and turns the evidence into practical next steps.</p></div></div></section>

  <section class="section product-section" id="inside-the-audit"><div class="shell product-grid"><div class="product-intro"><p class="eyebrow">02 / The visibility audit</p><h2>Understand<br />the answer.<br /><span class="muted">Then change<br />what you can.</span></h2><p>A written report for your business, with the evidence behind every recommendation.</p><div class="delivery-note"><span class="delivery-value">2 working days</span><span>From confirmed scope and payment<br />to your finished report.</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">How the audit works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><AuditExplorer /></div></section>

  <section class="section proof-section"><div class="shell"><div class="proof-top"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Evidence, before promises</p><span class="fine">Our original self-audit · August 2026</span></div><div class="proof-composition"><div class="proof-story"><h2>Our first finding?<br />We had the<br /><span>wrong name.</span></h2><p>Before selling an audit, we ran one on ourselves. The assistants either missed us entirely or described a different company. We published the report and changed our name from Noven to Wardith.</p><a class="text-link light-link" href="/ask-your-ai/self-audit/">Read the original findings <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="fine proof-disclosure">Original report with two declared redactions. Historical findings, not current Wardith or client results.</p></div><div class="proof-stat"><span class="stat-label">Times our business was named</span><div class="zero-stat">0<span>/168</span></div><p>Answers to questions that didn’t mention us by name.</p><div class="stat-rule"></div><div class="secondary-stat"><strong>30/30</strong><p>Name-based checks described<br />a different company.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section commercial-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / A sensible first step</p><h2>Start small.<br />Make an informed decision.</h2></div><div class="commercial-grid"><article class="audit-offer"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your starting point</p><h3>The visibility audit</h3><p>Know where you stand before deciding what to spend next.</p></div><div class="offer-bottom"><span class="offer-price">{money(audit.price)}<small>one-off</small></span><a href="/pricing/" class="round-link" aria-label="See audit pricing and inclusions">↗</a></div><div class="offer-foot">Written evidence. Clear priorities. No tie-in.</div></article><div class="next-work"><p>What happens after the audit?</p><details open><summary><span>Fix what’s worth fixing</span><span>{money(foundation.price)}</span></summary><p>Foundation addresses agreed issues on your existing site, including business information and two permanent answer pages. A one-off piece of work.</p></details><details><summary><span>Keep an eye on the answers</span><span>From {money(maintain.price)}/mo</span></summary><p>Optional monthly checks and improvements as your business and the assistants change. No minimum term.</p></details><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">Compare the full scope <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section questions-section"><div class="shell questions-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A few things worth asking</p><h2>Clear on the work.<br /><span class="muted">Clear on the limits.</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/faq/">All your questions, answered <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Can you guarantee AI will recommend me?</summary><p>No. Assistants control their answers. We test what they say and work on the website and business information we can influence.</p></details><details><summary>Is this right for my business?</summary><p>It is designed for UK service businesses whose customers research and compare before buying, including accountants, clinics, solicitors, consultancies and agencies.</p></details><details><summary>Who does the work?</summary><p>Kieran Smith, Wardith’s founder. You work directly with the person who runs the tests, investigates the findings and writes your report.</p><a href="/about/">Meet Kieran</a></details><details><summary>What if I don’t need more work?</summary><p>The report says so. You can act on the findings yourself, give them to another provider, or stop with the audit.</p></details><details><summary>Can I check your own website’s business information?</summary><p>Yes. This is the same structured business record published in this page’s source.</p><Code caption="Wardith’s published business information" label="Wardith organisation JSON-LD" data={organizationSchema(Astro.site)} /></details></div></div></section>
</Base>
